        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    returns_a = [0.05, 0.02, -0.03, 0.04]\n    returns_b = [0.06, 0.01, -0.02, 0.03]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    mean_a = sum(returns_a) / len(returns_a)\n    mean_b = sum(returns_b) / len(returns_b)\n    covariance = sum(\n        (a - mean_a) * (b - mean_b)\n        for a, b in zip(returns_a, returns_b)\n    ) / (len(returns_a) - 1)\n    answer = round(covariance, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
